## 3. Token Contract

[Complete set of design tokens for this system. Every token entry requires a name, value, and intent. Tokens are organized by category. L2 specs must reference tokens by name — never by raw value.]

### Color

| Token | Value | Intent |
|-------|-------|--------|
| color-action-primary | | Primary interactive affordance |
| color-action-primary-dark | | Hover/pressed state of primary action |
| color-action-secondary | | Secondary interactive affordance |
| color-text-primary | | Body text, headings |
| color-text-secondary | | Supporting text, captions |
| color-text-disabled | | Disabled state text |
| color-text-on-action | | Text on colored action surfaces |
| color-surface-base | | Page / canvas background |
| color-surface-raised | | Card, modal, elevated surface |
| color-surface-overlay | | Modal backdrop |
| color-border-default | | Default border |
| color-border-focus | | Keyboard focus ring |
| color-semantic-error | | Error states |
| color-semantic-success | | Success states |
| color-semantic-warning | | Warning states |
| color-semantic-info | | Informational states |
| color-focus-ring | | Focus ring color |

### Typography

| Token | Value | Intent |
|-------|-------|--------|
| typography-display-lg | | Page-level display headings |
| typography-heading-xl | | Section headings |
| typography-heading-lg | | |
| typography-heading-md | | |
| typography-body-lg | | Primary body text |
| typography-body-md | | Standard body text |
| typography-body-sm | | Small body text, captions |
| typography-label-lg | | Form labels, tabs |
| typography-label-md | | Button labels |
| typography-label-sm | | Tags, badges |
| typography-code | | Inline and block code |

### Spacing

| Token | Value | Intent |
|-------|-------|--------|
| spacing-1 | | Tight internal padding |
| spacing-2 | | Default internal padding |
| spacing-3 | | Standard component padding |
| spacing-4 | | Section internal spacing |
| spacing-6 | | Component-to-component gap |
| spacing-8 | | Section-to-section gap |
| spacing-12 | | Layout sections |
| spacing-16 | | Page-level spacing |

### Radius

| Token | Value | Intent |
|-------|-------|--------|
| radius-sm | | Chips, badges, small elements |
| radius-md | | Buttons, inputs |
| radius-lg | | Cards, modals |
| radius-full | | Pills, avatars |

### Shadow

| Token | Value | Intent |
|-------|-------|--------|
| shadow-sm | | Subtle elevation (dropdowns) |
| shadow-md | | Cards, raised surfaces |
| shadow-lg | | Modals, dialogs |
| shadow-focus | | Focus ring shadow |

### Motion

| Token | Value | Intent |
|-------|-------|--------|
| motion-duration-fast | | Micro-interactions (hover, toggle) |
| motion-duration-standard | | State transitions |
| motion-duration-slow | | Modal entry/exit, page transitions |
| motion-ease-standard | | Default easing |
| motion-ease-enter | | Elements entering the screen |
| motion-ease-exit | | Elements leaving the screen |

